{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/215829a3ff5c2f64b129cbcb84b642a8.avif?t=1760567127\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just started working in the mailroom of that weird building on 5th. The job was easy enough at first. Sort the mail and use their creaky old pneumatic tube system to send it to the correct departments. But then shit started getting weird. Can you figure out what's really going on in this place and find a way out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*THE DEMO INCLUDES DAY 1 IN THE MAILROOM AND LASTS ABOUT 20 MINUTES.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mailroom is a short horror game about working a dead-end job in a basement mailroom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use clues to correctly identify and sort mail</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/ffbb05fc1920ca944bf7c78e8dbae804.poster.avif?t=1760567127\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/ffbb05fc1920ca944bf7c78e8dbae804.webm?t=1760567127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/ffbb05fc1920ca944bf7c78e8dbae804.mp4?t=1760567127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dissect and process raw ingredients into materials needed by the upper floors</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/1842cebd8c7894a25d42dae622dc40cd.poster.avif?t=1760567127\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/1842cebd8c7894a25d42dae622dc40cd.webm?t=1760567127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/1842cebd8c7894a25d42dae622dc40cd.mp4?t=1760567127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools, magic, and blood to keep the mailroom equipment operational</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/16e8ff85ba5f1988ebd723cf8b7497f1.poster.avif?t=1760567127\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/16e8ff85ba5f1988ebd723cf8b7497f1.webm?t=1760567127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/16e8ff85ba5f1988ebd723cf8b7497f1.mp4?t=1760567127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what is going on in this building and try to find a way out before it's too late</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crunchy 3D art style</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043990?t=1760567127","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043990?t=1760567127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/6b0b087bed4c4e191beb29a84e922decf1f14c84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760567127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/6b0b087bed4c4e191beb29a84e922decf1f14c84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760567127","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/215829a3ff5c2f64b129cbcb84b642a8.avif?t=1760567127\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just started working in the mailroom of that weird building on 5th. The job was easy enough at first. Sort the mail and use their creaky old pneumatic tube system to send it to the correct departments. But then shit started getting weird. Can you figure out what's really going on in this place and find a way out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*THE DEMO INCLUDES DAY 1 IN THE MAILROOM AND LASTS ABOUT 20 MINUTES.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mailroom is a short horror game about working a dead-end job in a basement mailroom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use clues to correctly identify and sort mail</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/ffbb05fc1920ca944bf7c78e8dbae804.poster.avif?t=1760567127\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043990/extras/ffbb05fc1920ca944bf7c78e8dbae804.webm?t=1760567127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st